t tiles in my hand, it offers minimal value. Discarding T6 allows me to focus on building around my strong Dots concentration (B1-B6) which could lead to Full Flush (24 points) or other high-value patterns. The Dots tiles form natural sequences and have better wait potential.\n\nAnswer: Play T6"}
