g it allows me to focus on building a Half Flush or Full Flush pattern with Dots tiles, which offers much higher scoring potential (6-24 points). My Dots concentration (B1, B1, B2, B3, B4, B5, B6, B6) has multiple chow possibilities and can efficiently form a winning hand.\n\nAnswer: Play J2"}
