eed to reconsider - T1 is Bamboo suit (\u6761), not my strong suit. My strong suit is Dots (B1-B6). So T1 is isolated in the Bamboo suit while my main strength is in Dots.\n\nReason: T1 is completely isolated with no supporting tiles in the Bamboo suit, while my hand is heavily concentrated in the Dots suit (B1-B6). Discarding T1 keeps my options open for either a Half Flush (Dots + honors/characters) or potentially a Full Flush in Dots. W8 is also isolated, but keeping Character tiles gives slightly more flexibility for Half Flush patterns. With only 1 T1 remaining unshown and no support, T1 has the least value.\n\nAnswer: Play T1"}
